l":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/alex-hatch"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-7Zk","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/blog-AIO.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/30710","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=30710"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/30710\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":30776,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/30710\/revisions\/30776"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/30774"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=30710"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=30710"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=30710"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=30710"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":30796,"date":"2025-11-17T05:36:32","date_gmt":"2025-11-17T10:36:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=30796"},"modified":"2025-11-17T05:36:33","modified_gmt":"2025-11-17T10:36:33","slug":"dentoshi_below_100k_but_we_still_have_hope","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/dentoshi_below_100k_but_we_still_have_hope","title":{"rendered":"Trading Spaces recap: Liquidity jitters, BTC\u2019s \u201clast stand\u201d and why privacy coins won\u2019t quit"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-tl-dr\"><strong>TL;DR<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Macro:<\/strong> Liquidity\u2019s been tight since early November (SOFR\/IORB dynamics), but it\u2019s starting to normalize; policy shifts away from max QT should drip-feed support\u2014with a lag.<br><strong>BTC:<\/strong> Sitting on a <strong>do-or-die<\/strong> zone around the yearly open \/ 3D 100-EMA. Fast reclaim \u2192 relief; slow drift + failed reclaims \u2192 caution. <strong>Cautious bulls view the 94-98k range as a last stand support level<\/strong>, with invalidation on a clean breakdown that fails to spring.<br><strong>ETH:<\/strong> A shade stronger on lows vs BTC, but still needs <strong>trend reclaims<\/strong> before bulls get \u201cfun.\u201d<br><strong>Narratives:<\/strong> <strong>Privacy<\/strong> names (ZEC, XMR, DASH) led\u2014trade the <strong>leader<\/strong> until it clearly loses trend; avoid late beta-chasing in thin liquidity.<br><strong>DeFi watch:<\/strong> Uniswap\u2019s fee-switch proposal keeps the chart interesting, but <strong>headlines<\/strong> still drive it\u2014structure first, then narrative confirmation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why markets feel heavy (and what could change)<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Liquidity tightened hard at the start of November, a classic headwind for risk. While funding stresses are easing, markets typically <strong>price the sentiment before the liquidity lands<\/strong>. Add in fading odds of a near-term rate cut and patchy data flow, and you get outsized sensitivity: <strong>bad news has hit harder than good news has helped.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201cThere\u2019s a lag to all of this\u2014sentiment moves first; flows follow.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>BTC: Den\u2019s \u201chere or nowhere\u201d zone<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Den\u2019s map from prior shows had us eyeing this cluster for weeks; we\u2019re now <strong>there<\/strong>. The thesis: this cycle\u2019s tendency to <strong>dump into the 3D 100-EMA area, deviate briefly, then spring<\/strong> is still alive\u2014<strong>if<\/strong> we see quick absorption and a reclaim.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"530\" data-attachment-id=\"30803\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/dentoshi_below_100k_but_we_still_have_hope\/attachment\/01screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10-43-15\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?fit=2880%2C1490&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1490\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"01Screenshot 2025-11-16 at 10.43.15\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?fit=1024%2C530&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?resize=1024%2C530&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30803\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?resize=1024%2C530&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?resize=300%2C155&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?resize=768%2C397&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?resize=1536%2C795&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?resize=2048%2C1060&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?resize=1200%2C621&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/01Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.43.15.png?resize=193%2C100&amp;ssl=1 193w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What confirms strength<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Swift reclaim of the lost range and stacked EMAs (4H \u2192 D)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A <strong>fast reaction<\/strong> at the yearly open (narrow wicks, strong closes)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow-through from majors (breadth), not BTC alone<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"531\" data-attachment-id=\"30804\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/dentoshi_below_100k_but_we_still_have_hope\/attachment\/02screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10-44-33\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?fit=2880%2C1494&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1494\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"02Screenshot 2025-11-16 at 10.44.33\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?fit=1024%2C531&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?resize=1024%2C531&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30804\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?resize=1024%2C531&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?resize=300%2C156&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?resize=768%2C398&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?resize=1536%2C797&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?resize=2048%2C1062&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?resize=1200%2C623&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/02Screenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.44.33.png?resize=193%2C100&amp;ssl=1 193w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What breaks it<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Clean break below, <strong>weak retests<\/strong>, and failure to reclaim. That shifts bias defensive and strengthens the case that the top might be in.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>ETH: Slight relative strength, clear to-dos<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ETH hasn\u2019t made fresh lows in lockstep with BTC at the same moments\u2014<strong>a small positive<\/strong>. But bulls still need to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Reclaim the <strong>yearly open<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Flip EMAs<\/strong> bullish<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Attack the <strong>prior rejection shelf<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Until then, it\u2019s setup, not signal.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The privacy-coin revival <\/strong><strong><\/strong><strong>playbook<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>ZEC:<\/strong> Still the <strong>leader<\/strong>\u2014respecting trends across 4H\/D; as long as daily\/4H trends hold, the <strong>money\u2019s still in the leader<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"533\" data-attachment-id=\"30806\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/dentoshi_below_100k_but_we_still_have_hope\/attachment\/zecscreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10-46-08\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/ZECScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.08.png?fit=2880%2C1498&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1498\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}