k_but_we_still_have_hope\/attachment\/xmrscreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10-46-43-2\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?fit=2874%2C1486&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2874,1486\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"XMRScreenshot 2025-11-16 at 10.46.43\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?fit=1024%2C529&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?resize=1024%2C529&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30808\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?resize=1024%2C529&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?resize=300%2C155&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?resize=768%2C397&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?resize=1536%2C794&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?resize=2048%2C1059&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?resize=1200%2C620&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/XMRScreenshot-2025-11-16-at-10.46.43-1.png?resize=193%2C100&amp;ssl=1 193w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>DASH:<\/strong> Improving structure, but late-beta risk is higher when liquidity is thin.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"528\" data-attachment-id=\"30809\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/dentoshi_below_100k_but_we_still_have_hope\/attachment\/dash\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?fit=2880%2C1484&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1484\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"DASH\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?fit=1024%2C528&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?resize=1024%2C528&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30809\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?resize=1024%2C528&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?resize=300%2C155&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?resize=768%2C396&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?resize=1536%2C791&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?resize=2048%2C1055&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?resize=1200%2C618&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/DASH.png?resize=194%2C100&amp;ssl=1 194w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201cIn thin markets, trade the narrative\u2019s <strong>primary<\/strong>\u2014rotate only after the leader clearly weakens.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>DeFi flow watch: Uniswap\u2019s fee switch<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Governance chatter about turning on fee distributions sparked a quick <strong>news pop<\/strong> in prior weeks. Structure and tweets both matter, but the following need to line up:&nbsp; market as a whole bounces \u2192 UNI fee switch proposal going through \u2192 UNI chart holding supportn\u2014<strong>then<\/strong> the narrative can add fuel.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"535\" data-attachment-id=\"30810\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/dentoshi_below_100k_but_we_still_have_hope\/attachment\/uni\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?fit=2880%2C1504&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1504\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"UNI\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?fit=1024%2C535&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?resize=1024%2C535&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30810\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?resize=1024%2C535&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?resize=300%2C157&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?resize=768%2C401&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?resize=1536%2C802&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?resize=2048%2C1070&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?resize=1200%2C627&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/UNI.png?resize=191%2C100&amp;ssl=1 191w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Weekend checklist (and into next week)<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>BTC vs. yearly open \/ 3D 100-EMA:<\/strong> Look for <strong>swift reclaim<\/strong> and strong closes<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>ETH trend reclaims:<\/strong> Are bulls doing more than bouncing?<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Rates odds:<\/strong> Track the <strong>cut probabilities<\/strong>\u2014risk appetite has been swinging with them<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Liquidity tells:<\/strong> Funding normalization typically precedes price<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Narratives:<\/strong> If ZEC stumbles (daily\/4H trend loss), <strong>don\u2019t chase<\/strong> laggards\u2014wait for confirmation of rotation<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Catch the full replay on YouTube:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/-hJxX051zxs?si=rSWdKbeMyKgVJ4lJ\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Housekeeping<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Scheduling:<\/strong> Trading Spaces is <strong>pushed back one week<\/strong> for Thanksgiving. We\u2019ll be back <strong>Dec 5<\/strong>\u2014same time, same stream.<br><br><strong>Trading Spaces<\/strong> runs <strong>every two weeks<\/strong>; follow\u00a0<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/krakenfx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">@krakenfx<\/a><\/strong>,\u00a0<strong><a href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/krakenpro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">@krakenpro<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong><a href=\"http:\/\/x.com\/dentoshi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">@Dentoshi<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0for stream times, charts and highlights.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trade with Dentoshi on Kraken Pro<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Past Performance is not a reliable indicator of future results. <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/assets-cms.kraken.com\/files\/51n36hrp\/facade\/b0183f2a11a80bb2b79cf5cab244b6faf58b421b.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>Learn more about asset risks.<\/em><\/a><em> Pricing data is provided by Kraken. Returns may increase or decrease as a result of currency fluctuations, and does not account for trading fees. Visit our fee schedule for more information.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>BTC on the brink, liquidity gasping for air and privacy coins refusing to die &#8212; here\u2019s why the next few candles could decide the cycle.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":30814,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1391],"tags":[1946],"language":[],"class_list":["post-30796","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-crypto-education","tag-dentoshi"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Trading Spaces recap: Liquidity jitters, BTC\u2019s \u201clast stand\u201d and why privacy coins won\u2019t quit - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/dentoshi_below_100k_but_we_still_have_hope\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Trading Spaces recap: Liquidity jitters, BTC\u2019s \u201clast stand\u20