g","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/alex-hatch"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-84B","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Rayls-blog-header.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31037","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=31037"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31037\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":31038,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31037\/revisions\/31038"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/31061"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=31037"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=31037"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=31037"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=31037"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":31063,"date":"2025-12-01T09:00:02","date_gmt":"2025-12-01T14:00:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=31063"},"modified":"2025-12-01T09:00:04","modified_gmt":"2025-12-01T14:00:04","slug":"market-participation-program","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/kraken-institutional\/market-participation-program","title":{"rendered":"Kraken launches Market Participation Program"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-the-incentive-program-works\"><strong>How the incentive program works<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/institutions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kraken Institutional<\/a> introduces the Market Participation Program, a <strong>transparent, time-bound structure<\/strong> that our largest clients (by trading volume) can qualify for, subject to standard compliance and eligibility requirements. Participants who contribute significantly to market liquidity and trading activity can earn <strong>Kraken-equity-linked incentives*<\/strong> in the form of warrants \u2013 a first-of-its-kind approach among global Tier 1 crypto exchanges.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By tying rewards to our long-term success, we\u2019re creating shared alignment between our business and its most active participants. The more our markets thrive, the more everyone benefits \u2013 traders, investors and the broader crypto ecosystem.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Based on transparency and fairness, the Market Participation Program is <strong>open, competitive and rule-based<\/strong> \u2013 <strong>a clear, equitable path<\/strong> for qualified participants to contribute and be rewarded.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-liquidity-and-the-power-of-partnerships\"><strong>Liquidity and the power of partnerships<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Partnerships are where lasting success begins. It is the force that turns ambition into progress and progress into shared achievement. At Kraken, we believe that when people and purpose align, something greater than any one company takes shape, a living network of trust, innovation and resilience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When alignment among participants and healthy competition coexist in a level playing field, integrity sits at the core and markets can evolve. Liquidity strengthens and participation widens, improving market conditions for all of our clients.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every collaboration, every shared initiative, adds strength to the exchange itself. This is the first initiative but it won&#8217;t be an isolated effort; this is the first thread in a larger tapestry that will support market health and liquidity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Market Participation Program looks beyond the immediate horizon and invests in a future built on success, consistency and shared conviction. The success of our partners becomes our own, and in that mutual growth, Kraken becomes more than an exchange; it becomes a catalyst for lasting progress across the digital economy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-looking-ahead\"><strong>Looking ahead<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As we continue scaling our infrastructure and preparing for the next phase of growth, we\u2019re focused on programs that <strong>align client success with our mission<\/strong>: accelerating the global adoption of cryptocurrency through sound, transparent markets.<br><br>To learn more about the Market Participation Program, contact your Kraken relationship manager today. If you would like to inquire further about our account management services, please <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/institutions#contact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">contact our institutional team<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/institutions#contact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Contact Kraken Institutional<\/a><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>* Equity-linked incentives earned will be awarded as warrants exercisable for Kraken common stock<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Access Restricted to Accredited Investors (as defined in Rule 501 of the U.S. Securities Act) or Qualified Investors\/Professional Clients under UK, EU and Swiss law and \u201cprofessional investors\u201d under the Laws of Hong Kong. The information on this page and the materials it contains are not an offer to, or directed at, the public and are intended solely for institutional and professional market participants and other persons who are sophisticated or accredited investors or professional investors, or otherwise a person to whom this information may lawfully be communicated, each acting for their own account. The securities referred to herein have not been and will not be registered under the U.S. Securities Act, and may not be offered or sold in the United States, except pursuant to an applicable exemption from registration. By proceeding, you confirm and agree that: (i) you are not a retail client or consumer and will not rely on this communication or the information contained herein as such; (ii) you are a person to whom an offer of the securities described may lawfully be made under all applicable laws and regulations of your jurisdiction and you are not located in Hong Kong (or, if you are, you are a \u201cprofessional investor\u201d); (iii) you will not distribute, forward, or otherwise make any of the materials available to any retail person, including to any person in Hong Kong who is not a \u201cprofessional investor\u201d; and (iv) no regulator has reviewed or approved these materials. If you cannot make these confirmations, do not proceed. Nothing herein constitutes investment advice or a recommendation; you should make an independent assessment and seek independent advice as needed. Past performance is not indicative of future results. This communication does not constitute an offer to sell or solicitation of an offer to buy any securities in any jurisdiction in which the offering or sale is not permitted. Offers and sales of any securities hereby are subject to eligibility, acceptance, and final documentation.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We believe that stronger markets benefit everyone \u2013 from individual traders to institutional participants. That\u2019s why we\u2019re introducing a new incentive program that is designed to attract and retain the most active trading participants while creating a more vibrant, efficient trading environment for all.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":31064,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1969],"tags":[],"language":[],"class_list":["post-31063","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kraken-institutional"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Kraken launches Market Partic