tocks-Backed-Annoucement-Blog.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31071","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=31071"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31071\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":31086,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31071\/revisions\/31086"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/31087"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=31071"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=31071"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=31071"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=31071"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":31024,"date":"2025-12-03T05:10:10","date_gmt":"2025-12-03T10:10:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=31024"},"modified":"2025-12-03T05:10:11","modified_gmt":"2025-12-03T10:10:11","slug":"24-7-on-kraken-pro","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/xstocks\/24-7-on-kraken-pro","title":{"rendered":"xStocks: now trading 24\/7 on Kraken Pro"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We\u2019re excited to announce that <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/pro\/xstocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">xStocks<\/a> are now available for 24\/7 trading on <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kraken Pro<\/a>, giving eligible professional traders uninterrupted access to the industry\u2019s gold standard for tokenized equities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Until now, xStocks were tradable on Kraken Pro 24 hours a day, five days a week. This update extends that access to full 24\/7 coverage, allowing traders to execute strategies, manage risk and respond to global market developments in real time, including on weekends and public holidays.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This around-the-clock availability ensures professional traders can execute and manage positions with the depth, performance and precision of Kraken\u2019s institutional-grade infrastructure.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-phase-one-24-7-trading-for-top-10-xstocks\">Phase One: 24\/7 trading for top 10 xStocks<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The first phase of our rollout brings continuous trading to 10 of the most popular xStocks available on Kraken Pro, including: TSLAx, QQQx, SPYx, NVDAx, CRCLx, AAPLx, HOODx, MSTRx, GLDx and GOOGLx.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These assets represent the most active and liquid xStocks on our platform, offering deep markets and tight spreads around the clock. We\u2019ll be expanding this list to feature additional tokenized stocks and ETFs as part of our broader ambition to make tokenized markets truly global and continuous.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-why-this-matters-the-future-of-market-access-nbsp\">Why this matters: the future of market access&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This expansion marks a major step toward building markets that never close. As market volatility and investor activity increasingly extend beyond traditional trading hours, 24\/7 availability gives traders the flexibility to capture opportunities whenever they arise \u2014 without waiting for traditional markets to reopen.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By combining Kraken Pro\u2019s professional-grade execution and liquidity with the on-chain, 24\/7 settlement that has defined xStocks since launch, we are reinforcing a seamless bridge between traditional capital markets and digital assets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our goal is to make tokenized markets as efficient, transparent and accessible as crypto. The introduction of 24\/7 xStocks trading on Kraken Pro is another milestone in that journey, reinforcing our commitment to redefining how global markets operate.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Not a Kraken client yet? <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up?rfr=pro-web\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Create your account<\/a> and get verified to Intermediate or Pro now.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/pro\/xstocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trade xStocks 24\/7 on Kraken Pro<\/a><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em><em>xStocks are issued by Backed Assets (JE) Limited (a Jersey private limited company) and offered to eligible Kraken customers via Payward Digital Solutions Ltd. (\u201cPDSL\u201d), a company licensed to conduct digital asset business by the Bermuda Monetary Authority. xStocks are not nor will be registered with any local securities regulators. PDSL (Kraken) does not provide investment advice and\/or recommendations, and, no communication, through any Kraken App or website or otherwise, should be construed as such. Individual investors should make their own decisions or seek professional independent advice if they are unsure as to the suitability\/appropriateness of any investment for their circumstances or needs, including potential tax treatment. Investing in xStocks involves an element of risk. The value of an investment may go down as well as up, and past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results. Not available in the U.S. or to U.S. persons. Geo restrictions apply. Read Kraken\u2019s xStocks Risk Disclosure at <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/legal\/xstocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>kraken.com\/legal\/xstocks<\/em><\/a><em> as well as the Base Prospectus and related Final Terms for xStocks at <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/assets.backed.fi\/legal-documentation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>https:\/\/assets.backed.fi\/legal-documentation<\/em><\/a><em> to learn more.<\/em><\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Unlocking around-the-clock access to the most popular tokenized equities for Kraken Pro customers in 140+ countries<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":30737,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1947],"tags":[1937],"language":[],"class_list":["post-31024","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-xstocks","tag-tokenized"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>xStoc