.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2024\\\/06\\\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1\",\"width\":214,\"height\":64,\"caption\":\"Kraken Blog\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/logo\\\/image\\\/\"}},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/person\\\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf\",\"name\":\"KrakenFX\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/secure.gravatar.com\\\/avatar\\\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/secure.gravatar.com\\\/avatar\\\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/secure.gravatar.com\\\/avatar\\\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"caption\":\"KrakenFX\"},\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/author\\\/alex-hatch\"}]}<\/script>\n<!-- \/ Yoast SEO Premium plugin. -->","yoast_head_json":{"title":"Kraken and Deutsche B\u00f6rse announce strategic partnership to bridge traditional and digital markets - Kraken Blog","robots":{"index":"index","follow":"follow","max-snippet":"max-snippet:-1","max-image-preview":"max-image-preview:large","max-video-preview":"max-video-preview:-1"},"canonical":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/deutsche-borse-strategic-partnership","og_locale":"en_US","og_type":"article","og_title":"Kraken and Deutsche B\u00f6rse announce strategic partnership to bridge traditional and digital markets","og_description":"Combining regulated infrastructure with crypto-native expertise to deliver frictionless institutional access, the partnership encompasses regulated crypto, tokenized markets and derivatives, as well as enhanced liquidity for institutional clients across geographies.","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/deutsche-borse-strategic-partnership","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published