e,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=31254"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31254\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":31257,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31254\/revisions\/31257"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/31255"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=31254"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=31254"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=31254"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=31254"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":31226,"date":"2025-12-11T13:02:30","date_gmt":"2025-12-11T18:02:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=31226"},"modified":"2025-12-31T06:21:47","modified_gmt":"2025-12-31T11:21:47","slug":"holiday-gift-flip-2025","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/promotions\/holiday-gift-flip-2025","title":{"rendered":"Introducing Kraken\u2019s Holiday Gift Flip: Turn your worst Christmas gift into Bitcoin"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">And it\u2019s not just annoying, it\u2019s expensive. Every year, billions of dollars are spent on festive gifts that are unused, unappreciated and ultimately forgotten.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This holiday season, Kraken is giving everyone the chance to flip that disappointment into something more exciting, and perhaps a bit more meaningful: Bitcoin.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/uOHtp3vXfiQ?si=mm4LeKfiBEslpuZF\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to our Gift Flip, a community-driven holiday campaign that turns gift guilt into better gifts, all while having some fun.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-the-gift-flip-works-nbsp\"><strong>How the Gift Flip works:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Starting December 25<\/strong>, take a photo or record a video of your worst Christmas gift.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Then, think of your funniest roast for your Christmas gift.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Post your picture and <a href=\"http:\/\/www.x.com\/@krakenfx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">roast on X<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/krakenfx\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@krakenfx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TikTok<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/www.reddit.com\/r\/Kraken\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Reddit<\/a> tagging #GiftFlip and <a href=\"http:\/\/www.x.com\/@krakenfx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">@krakenfx<\/a>.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>That\u2019s it. You\u2019re officially in the running to win Bitcoin, straight into your Kraken account.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Between December 25 and January 19<\/strong>, our team will be reviewing the submissions, selecting over 150 winners to receive a share of <strong>5 bitcoins in prizes<\/strong>. We\u2019re also introducing a few special award categories, including Most Creative Roast, Most Random Roast, Rapid Roasts (the best one-liner roasts), and the coveted GOAT Roast.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><strong>Winners will be notified via direct message from @krakenfx on the social platform that they entered, within seven days of the competition ending. <\/strong><\/strong>BTC prizes will be credited directly to verified Kraken accounts within 60 days of winner confirmation. Accounts must remain open and in good standing at the time of crediting.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Remember: The worse your gift, and the funnier you are, the better your odds.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-more-ways-to-gift-with-kraken\"><strong>More ways to gift with Kraken<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This holiday season, we\u2019re going even further with rewards:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83c\udf81 New to Kraken? If you sign up between December 8-24, verify your account, and trade $350, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/giftofbitcoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">we\u2019ll add a $50 Bitcoin bonus<\/a> to your balance as a holiday gift.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83d\udc8c Already a Kraken customer? You\u2019ll get <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/giftofbitcoin#:~:text=Your%20turn%20to%20play%20Santa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">a free $125 Bitcoin gift card to give to someone<\/a> who isn\u2019t on Kraken yet (but should be). This is our way of sharing the crypto spirit this holiday season, and helping more people to start their journey into the digital asset world.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83c\udf89 And that\u2019s not all: Eligible customers will enter into <a href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/promotions\/win-3-bitcoins-holiday-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">a trading lottery<\/a> with a chance to win additional Bitcoin rewards (geographic restrictions apply).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So whether you\u2019re flipping bad gifts, signing up for the first time, or inviting a friend or family member to join the crypto revolution, there\u2019s something for everyone this season.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-why-we-re-giving-the-gift-of-bitcoin-nbsp\"><strong>Why we\u2019re giving the gift of Bitcoin&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It\u2019s simple. We believe in giving people more control over their financial future and having some fun along the way. Gift Flip is a lighthearted reminder that value is what you make of it, and even a bad gift can become an opportunity to find something better when you take the leap into crypto.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Because while the holidays are full of surprises, Bitcoin is one gift that keeps on giving.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-ready-to-flip-your-gift\"><strong>Ready to flip your gift?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>From December 25-January 19<\/strong>: Snap it. Roast it. Post it. Tag #GiftFlip <a href=\"http:\/\/www.x.com\/@krakenfx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">on X<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/krakenfx\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Instagram<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@krakenfx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TikTok<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/www.reddit.com\/r\/Kraken\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Reddit<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We\u2019ll be watching as we hand out around $400,000 in BTC, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/giftofbitcoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">$50 signup bonuses<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/giftofbitcoin#:~:text=Your%20turn%20to%20play%20Santa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">$125 referral rewards<\/a> and a chance to <a href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/promotions\/win-3-bitcoins-holiday-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">win up to 3 BTC in our trading lottery<\/a> this holiday season.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This year, don\u2019t return or sell your bad gifts &#8212; flip them into Bitcoin.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/giftofbitcoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explore Kraken holiday promos<\/a><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Geographic restrictions apply. Void where prohibited by law. See full terms and conditions on the following links: <\/em><a href=\"http:\/\/kraken.com\/legal\/the-gift-card-terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>kraken.com\/legal\/the-gift-card-terms<\/em><\/a><em> and <\/em><a href=\"http:\/\/kraken.com\/legal\/holiday-new-user-promotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>kraken.com\/legal\/holiday-new-user-promotion<\/em><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Every year, someone unwraps a gift that probably should have stayed in the shop. A novelty mug. A pair of socks that say \u201cLive, Laugh, Love.\u201d A kitchen gadget no one asked for. We\u2019ve all been there.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":31140,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1793],"tags":[],"language":[],"class_list":["post-31226","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-promotions"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Introducing Kraken\u2019s Holiday Gift Flip: Turn your worst Christmas gift into Bitcoin - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/promotions\/holiday-gift-flip-2025\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Introducing Kraken\u2019s Holiday Gift Flip: Turn your worst Christmas gift into Bitcoin\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Every year, someone unwraps a gift that probably should have stayed in the shop. A novelty mug. A pair of socks that say \u201cLive, Laugh, Love.\u201d A kitchen gadget no one asked for. We\u2019ve all been there.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/promotions\/holiday-gift-flip-2025\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Kraken Blog\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-12-11T18:02:30+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-12-31T11:21:47+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/BLOG_Xmas-BTC-Sweepstakes_email-1-1024x467.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1024\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"467\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"KrakenFX\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n