zed tokenized stocks and ETFs to be available to millions via Wallet in Telegram, merging traditional finance with the speed and scale of TON Blockchain.","og_url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/xstocks\/bringing-tokenized-equities-to-ton-blockchain","og_site_name":"Kraken Blog","article_published_time":"2025-12-18T11:13:29+00:00","article_modified_time":"2025-12-18T11:13:31+00:00","og_image":[{"width":4096,"height":1868,"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/G8cmfHRbgAAzk-j.jpeg","type":"image\/jpeg"}],"author":"KrakenFX","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"Written by":"KrakenFX","Est. reading time":"3 minutes"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/xstocks\/bringing-tokenized-equities-to-ton-blockchain#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/xstocks\/bringing-tokenized-equities-to-ton-blockchain"},"author":{"name":"KrakenFX","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf"},"headline":"xStocks bringing tokenized equities to TON blockchain and Telegram\u2019s 1 billion users","datePublished":"2025-12-18T11:13:29+00:00","dateModified":"2025-12-18T11:13:31+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/xstocks\/bringing-tokenized-equities-to-ton-blockchain"},"wordCount":638,"commentCount":0,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/xstocks\/bringing-tokenized-equities-to-ton-blockchain#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/G8cmfHRbgAAzk-j.jpeg?fit=4096%2C1868&ssl=1","keywords":["tokenized"],"articleSection":["xstocks"],"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"CommentAction","name":"Comment","target":["https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/xstocks\/bringing-tokenized-equities-to-ton-blockchain#respond"]}]},{"@type":"Web